  <data key="d36">Demonstrated reliance of military operations on commercial satellite and comms elevates dual‑use concerns among legislators and regulators, triggering tighter export controls, compliance audits and sector‑specific oversight focused on AI and associated suppliers in the US–China rivalry.</data>
