  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A higher energy disruption risk premium raises operational energy costs for large-scale training and inference fleets, squeezing margins and causing cloud and AI service providers to slow capacity expansion and thus reduce near‑term revenue growth.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_regional_escalation</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
