  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Direct interdictions, reroutings and delays of tankers and LNG carriers create large, inconsistent shortfalls and timing uncertainty in deliveries that force rapid rebalancing in spot markets and widen price dispersion and realized volatility.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_regional_escalation</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_volatility</data>
