  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Acute increases in maritime disruptions delay and raise the cost of delivering specialised AI hardware (GPUs, networking gear) from East Asian manufacturers, prompting lead investors and syndicates to pause or downsize rounds for compute‑heavy AI startups faced with immediate supply constraints.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_regional_escalation</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
</edge>
