  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Persistent or visible failures to secure key commodity supplies undermine public perceptions of government competence and regulatory capacity, eroding trust in core institutions over subsequent months.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_energy_volatility</data>
  <data key="d39">global_political_realign</data>
