  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising assessed commodity supply-disruption risk prompts shipping companies, insurers and naval actors to reroute, delay or interdict voyages and for states to escalate maritime interdiction/escorting operations, directly increasing the observed rate of seaborne transport disruptions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_energy_volatility</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_escalation</data>
</edge>
