  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Disruptions in energy and critical metal supplies constrain manufacturing, launch cadence and ground‑station upkeep for commercial satcom providers, reducing available bandwidth and coverage in the theatre.</data>
