  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Falling institutional trust prompts legislators and regulators to open investigations and introduce tighter oversight of prominent AI developers to restore public confidence, whereas rising trust reduces political pressure for new scrutiny.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_political_realign</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
</edge>
